  "pal_park_encounters": [],
  "form_descriptions": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "ほんきになると　たたんでいた　あしでたちあがり　けっせんモードになる。たんじかんで　てきを　せいあつする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "진심을 다하게 되면 접었던 다리로 일어나 결전 모드로 변하여 단시간에 적을 제압한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "認真起來時會用折起的腳站起來，進入決戰模式。會在短時間內鎮壓住敵人。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Quand les choses deviennent sérieuses, il passe en mode assaut et se tient sur son autre paire de pattes. Il neutralise ses ennemis en un clin d’œil.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Macht es ernst, so stellt es sich auf sein zuvor eingeklapptes Beinpaar und schaltet in den Showdown-Modus. So bezwingt es Gegner im Nu.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando decide luchar sin cuartel, se alza con su tercer par de patas y entra en modo asalto. Acaba con el rival en un abrir y cerrar de ojos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Quando la lotta si fa seria, si erge sulle zampe che di solito tiene ripiegate e assume lo stile assalto per sopraffare il nemico in un lampo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "When it decides to fight all out, it stands on its previously folded legs to enter Showdown Mode. It neutralizes its enemies in short order.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "本気になると　畳んでいた　脚で立ち上がり　決戦モードになる。短時間で　敵を　制圧する。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "认真起来时会靠折起的脚站起来进入决战模式。会在短时间内压制敌人。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando decide luchar sin cuartel, se alza con su tercer par de patas y entra en modo asalto. Acaba con el rival en un abrir y cerrar de ojos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "たたまれた　だい３のあしを　つかうけっせんモードは　からだの　ふたんがおおきいため　ながくは　つづかない。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "접혀 있던 제3의 다리를 사용하는 결전 모드는 몸에 오는 부담이 크기 때문에 길게는 사용할 수 없다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "進入決戰模式時會使用折疊起的第３對腳，但由於會造成身體很大的負擔，因此無法久戰。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "En mode assaut, il se tient sur sa troisième paire de pattes habituellement repliée, mais il s’épuise relativement rapidement.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es kann den Showdown-Modus, bei dem es sein eingeklapptes drittes Beinpaar nutzt, nicht lange aufrechterhalten, da er seinen Körper strapaziert.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es incapaz de mantener durante mucho tiempo su modo asalto, con el tercer par de patas extendido, por el agotamiento que le produce.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Non può mantenere a lungo lo stile assalto, nel quale sfrutta il paio di zampe che di solito tiene ripiegate, perché gli costa moltissima fatica.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It uses its normally folded third set of legs when in Showdown Mode. This places a huge burden on its body, so it can’t stay in this mode for long.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "畳まれた　第３の脚を　使う決戦モードは　体の　負担が大きいため　長くは　続かない。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "进入决战模式时会使用折叠起来的第３双脚，这会给它身体造成很大的负担，因此无法久战。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es incapaz de mantener durante mucho tiempo su modo asalto, con el tercer par de patas extendido, por el agotamiento que le produce.",
      "language": {
